div.p:
“The events which very soon will be known to the world will confirm my assertion;
                    and of your excellency’s visit to this country I am confident that only the most
                    agreeable and imperishable recollections will remain.

“Then came the long-drawn-out negotiations for the sale of the canal property;
                    the examination of the titles, and the preparation of legal documents in respect
                    to the transfer of title to the United States.
